reconfigure.description:
Update the host, username or password for this gateway. Your existing entities, history and imported statistics are kept - only the connection details change. Optionally, enter a second login for 2.8.0 only. Leaving both fields empty removes it.

Optionally import history again: choose below for which value you want to upload a TraveNetz CSV. Each chosen value gets its own step. Choosing nothing means no import.

Installed integration version: {version}

{debug_info}

